  "fields": {
    "title": "No-Code Editor",
    "textContent": {
      "nodeType": "document",
      "data": {},
      "content": [
        {
          "nodeType": "heading-3",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Description",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "No-code editors have a graphical user interface that makes it possible to create websites using a building-block system. Often they also provide predesigned templates, which make the creation of a website even faster. The idea behind this is, that people without programming knowledge can easily create their own applications. No-code editors have developed significantly in the last few years and allow the creation of a wide range of applications. They also support the insertion of custom code snippets.",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "No-code editors are also quite popular among designers because of their ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "2SDgfBJb0TqIw0u9MPTzLf",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "WYSIWYG",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": " interface, which often resembles layout programs from the print sector. This makes No-code editors user-friendly and accessible, but also means that websites created with them feel often very similar due to the limited number of prefabricated components and interaction options. They are therefore criticised for contributing to a homogeneous web landscape and promoting ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "1a5QRShaM3BTIUyY1rsLkP",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "generic template design",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": ". It is strange hat the use of No-code editors and prefabricated templates is accepted, although it would be unthinkable in other design areas. Movements like ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "7g0kqpwVqPkAYh7KpHl2Dd",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "Handmade Web",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": " deliberately oppose the use of no-code editors and promote coding for designers.",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
